BEGIN:VCALENDAR
PRODID:-//notapattern//calendar export 1.0//EN
VERSION:2.0
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Inter Alia
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1006698
DTSTAMP:20261016T214953Z
DTSTART:20261111T003000Z
DTEND:20261111T021500Z
SUMMARY:Inter Alia
LOCATION:Music Box Theatre, 239 West 45th Street, New York NY 10036
DESCRIPTION:<p>Following an acclaimed, sold out run at London&rsquo;s
  National Theatre and a smash-hit West End transfer, Rosamund Pike
  (<em>Gone Girl</em>, <em>Saltburn</em>) brings her Olivier Award-winning
  &ldquo;tour de force&rdquo; (<em>Metro</em>) performance to Broadway in a
  &ldquo;searing legal drama&rdquo; (<em>Guardian</em>) from the writer and
  director of the global phenomenon <em>Prime Facie</em>. <br /><br
  />Jessica Parks is a maverick London Crowd Court judge; sharp,
  compassionate, and determined to change a system she knows isn&rsquo;t
  always just. But her career exists inter alia (&ldquo;among other
  things&rdquo;) as she balances motherhood, friendship, and the elusive
  notion of having it all. So, when an unthinkable event rocks her finely
  tuned life, can she hold her family together &ndash; or will everything
  fall apart?</p>
END:VEVENT
